## 2. Where to prune (operators)

Discovery never applies deletes. Automated prune apply is out of scope.
A human reviews this plan after endpoints have moved.

**Order:** (1) rehome or shut access ports (2) remove VLAN from non-exempt trunks
(3) `no interface Vlan{{ report.vlan_id }}` (4) `no vlan {{ report.vlan_id }}`.

Static routes, BGP neighbors, and VRF teardown are **not** prune actions. See section 3
(they often belong to a **shared VRF**).

